<h2 id="story-h" class="h2" style="color:#ED217C">Our story</h2>
<div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:22px; max-width:640px">
<p style="margin:0; font-size:20px; line-height:1.65; font-weight:500">“I’ve had a passion for helping cats all my life. Ever since I was a little girl, I would always try to help cats in need. I always dreamed of opening my own rescue when I got older, and now that dream is a reality.”</p>
<p style="margin:0; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#1F3158">Katrina, founder</p>
<p style="margin:12px 0 0; font-size:17px; line-height:1.75">Our team is made up of dedicated volunteers who work tirelessly to ensure that every cat in our care receives the love and support they deserve. From rescuing strays to rehabilitating and rehoming them, we are committed to making a difference in the lives of cats in need.</p>
</div>
